    "answer": {
      "short": "(b) $y=(x^2-1)(x-1)$",
      "worked": "For the two reflections, replace $x$ by $-x$ and negate the output.\n\n$$\\begin{align*} y&=-(-x-1)(-x+1)^2\\\\ y&=(x+1)(x-1)^2\\\\ y&=(x+1)(x-1)(x-1)\\\\ y&=(x^2-1)(x-1) \\end{align*}$$\n\nCorrect answer: b.",
